Package: ft991a-radio-control
Version: 0.0.1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Matt Franklin <radiombf@gmail.com>
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17)
License: Apache-2.0
Description: Yaesu FT-991A terminal radio control
 Terminal-based CAT control for the Yaesu FT-991A HF/VHF/UHF transceiver.
 Uses io_uring for low-latency serial I/O and ratatui for the TUI.
 .
 Includes:
  - ft991a-control: main control application (also supports a headless
    network server mode and a remote TCP client mode)
  - ft991a-emulator: virtual radio emulator (PTY-based, no hardware needed)
  - rs232c-pintest: RS-232C wiring/pin diagnostic tool
 .
 Requires Linux kernel 5.1+ for io_uring support.
Homepage: https://github.com/kf0uwv/ft991a
